.TH COMPVER 5 "October 2026" "APKGENG 1.12.5" "Amix File Formats"
.SH NAME
compver \- versions a package is compatible with
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B install/compver
.SH DESCRIPTION
A package may carry a
.B compver
file, named in its prototype(5) as
.BR "i compver" .
It lists earlier versions of the package that this version can stand in
for, one per line.  Lines starting with
.B #
are comments.
.PP
.BR pkgadd (1M)
keeps the file of the installed package in
.BI /var/sadm/pkg/ pkginst /install/compver\fR.
When another package's
.BR depend (5)
file asks for a version of this package, the request is met if the
installed version equals it, or else if a line of the installed
package's
.B compver
does.  Versions are compared as text: leading and trailing white space is
ignored and a run of white space inside a version counts as one space;
otherwise the characters must match exactly.  There are no ranges and no
ordering.
.SH EXAMPLE
A package at
.B VERSION=2.1
that can replace its 2.0 releases:
.PP
.nf
# versions this one is compatible with
2.0
2.0.1
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP 40
.BI /var/sadm/pkg/ pkginst /install/compver
the installed package's copy
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR depend (5),
.BR pkginfo (5),
.BR prototype (5),
.BR pkgadd (1M)
